        "citations": null,
        "text": "Great question \u2014 and it's actually a surprisingly contentious debate, much like the GIF vs. JIF argument! Here's a breakdown:\n\n---\n\n## How to Pronounce \"Doge\" \ud83d\udc15\n\n",
        "type": "text"
