        "text": "According to Wikipedia, \"doge\" can be pronounced **/do\u028a\u0292/** (\"dohzh\"), **/do\u028ad\u0292/** (\"dohj\"), or **/do\u028a\u0261/** (\"dohg\").",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": null,
        "text": "\n\nThere are essentially **5 common pronunciations** people use:\n\n### 1. \ud83c\udfc6 \"Dohj\" (Most Widely Accepted)\n**Rhymes with:** *Taj* (as in Taj Mahal)\n\n",
        "type": "text"
      },
      {
        "citations": [
          {
            "cited_text": "The correct pronunciation of Dogecoin is \u201cdohj coin\u201d, which would be written as \u02c8d\u0259\u028a\u0292k\u0254\u026an using the International Phonetic Alphabet (IPA). You can hea...",
